>
>term renderDocStringWith = (λrender.λs.docSegmentsWith render (parse.docs.parseDocString s))@{description="Parse a documentation string and render it using a custom {@type hydra.core.packaging.EntityReference} renderer. Text segments are passed through; ref segments are rendered by the provided function. Unrecognized doc-escape blocks are passed through as text."}
